      "This also explains why the tool is free without tricks. Server-based voices cost money every time they speak, which is why many sites ration them behind sign-ups, daily limits, watermarks, or subscriptions. Device voices cost the website nothing, because your own phone or computer does the speaking. So there is no catch hidden in the corner: no account to create, no trial quietly ticking down, and no reason for us to collect your text in exchange for the service. A good habit still applies whenever you use any tool on a shared or public computer: clear the text box when you finish, just as you would log out of an account. But as far as this page is concerned, when you close it, your words close with it.",
