      "Kuch sawal bilkul amli qisam ke hain. Awaz hisson ke darmiyan kyun rukti hai? Kyunki lambi tehreer jan boojh kar jumlon jitne hisson mein baanti jati hai taake har hissa saaf chale, aur konsa hissa chal raha hai yeh batane wala ishara is liye hai ke aap sath sath chal sakain. Resume ne wahin se shuru kyun nahi kiya jahan roka tha? Kyunki kuch browsers, khas tor par Chrome, pause ko isi terah samajhte hain, lekin hissa chhota honay ki wajah se dohrai bhi chhoti hi hoti hai. Kya yeh internet ke baghair chalega? Awazen installed hon aur page ek dafa khula ho to bolne ka kaam device ka apna hai, lekin koi bhi web page pehli dafa kholne ke liye connection to chahiye hi hota hai."
