      "Dusri cheez dohrana hai. Machine aksar aik hi mutadif (synonym) baar baar istemal karti hai, aik hi transition phrase, jaisay 'is ke ilawa' ya 'mazeed ye ke' har paragraph mein ghusa hota hai. Aik do dafa ye jumle sab istemal karte hain, lekin jab har hissay mein wohi qalib dikhe to tool usay note kar leta hai.",
