      "Dusra step: check wala button dabayen aur chand lamhay intezaar karein. Natije mein aap ko jumle rangon ke sath nazar ayenge. Garam rang wale jumlon ko gaur se parhein, wahi hain jin mein dohrana, hamwaari ya machine-wala lehja zyada hai.",
      "Teesra step: in garam jumlon ko apne alfaaz mein dobara likhein. Jumla tort dein, apni misaal shamil karein, ya apni asal raaye daalein. Phir dobara check karein. Aik do martaba ki is mashq se aap ko khud andaaza ho jayega ke kaunse jumle kamzor lagte hain. Yehi is tool ka asal faida hai: ye aap ko sikhata hai, sirf score nahi deta.",
