      "Teachers aur editors ke liye bhi ye madadgaar hai, lekin aik had ke sath. Agar kisi student ki tehreer mein har jumla garam rang mein aaye to ye aik ishara hai ke baat chit ki zaroorat hai, ye sabot nahi ke us ne dhoka diya. Sirf detector ki report par saza ya faisla karna insaf nahi hoga.",
      "Bloggers aur content writers ke liye is ka faida mukhtasir hai: publish karne se pehle draft check kar liya, jahan lehja bohat robot sa laga, wahan apni zaati mi sal ya apna tajurba shamil kar diya. Tehreer qudrati bhi lagti hai aur parhne wale ko bhi achi lagti hai.",
