      "Dusri had zabaan ki hai. Urdu tehreer par ye tools abhi English jitne mazboot nahi hain, kyunki in ki training zyada taraf English data par hui hai. To Urdu mazmoon ka natija ehtiyat se parhein, usay aakhri faisla na samjhein. Ye baat hum khud apne tool par bhi laagu karte hain.",
      "Teesri baat: score ko kismat ka likha na samjhein. Aik hi tehreer mukhtalif tools mein mukhtalif natija degi. Is liye report ko 'khoj' samjhein, 'court ka faisla' na samjhein. Asal tehreer hamesha insaan ki niyat aur mehnat se banti hai, aur asli quality yehi hai.",
