      "Teesra step: meta description likhein. Is mein do cheezain honi chahiyein: page par kya milega, aur click karne ki wajah. Lambai itni rakhein ke mobile par poora nazar aye, takreeban do chhoti linein. Agar tool suggestion de to use hazaar bar parh kar apni zuban mein likh lein, kyunki aap ke customer aap ki zuban samajhte hain.",
