      "Paanchva step: readability check karwayein. Agar tool lambe jumle ya sakht alfaz bataye to unhen chhota aur asan karein. Apne page ko khud zor se parh kar dekhein: jahan saans rukay, wahan jumla khatam karna chahiye tha.",
