      "Bloggeron aur chhoti website chalane walon ke liye bhi ye kaam ka hai, khaas tor par jab har article ke liye title aur description banana hota hai aur waqt kam hota hai. Tool aap ko shuruaat de deta hai, aap use apne andaz mein dhaal lete hain.",
      "Lekin agar aap ki website badi hai aur aap competition wale alfaz par nazar rakh rahe hain, jahan bare bare brands khade hain, to sirf ye tool kaafi nahi hoga. Wahan gehri research, backlinks aur mehnat chahiye. Ye tool pehla qadam hai, aakhri manzil nahi.",
