      "Dusri hadd: keyword ki suggestions aap ke text par mabni hoti hain, asli search data par nahi. Yani tool andaza lagata hai ke log kya search kar sakte hain, lekin wo nahi batata ke maheene mein kitne log ye asal mein search karte hain, aur kitni baree websites pehle se us par khadi hain. Asal competition dekhne ke liye khud Google par search kar ke pehle page ko dekhna parta hai: agar wahan bare brands aur purani websites hain, to wo keyword mushkil hai, chaahe tool jo bhi kahe.",
      "Teesri baat: zyada keywords ghusana madad nahi karta, nuqsaan karta hai. Purane zamane mein ye harkat chalti thi, ab Google ise pehchanta hai aur page ko neeche kar deta hai. Aik page, aik mauzu, aik keyword. Yehi asal usool hai jo tool bhi madad karta hai us par amal karne mein.",
      "Chauthi hadd waqt ki hai. SEO ek raat mein nahi hota. Nae page ko Google par ane mein hafton lag sakte hain, aur bharosa banane mein maheene. Tool is safar ko asan karta hai, chhota nahi karta.",
      "7. Aakhri baat aur aam sawal",
