      "Sawal 1: Kya tool istemal karne se mera page pehle number par aa jayega? Jawab: Aisa koi dawa hum nahi karte aur na koi imaandaar banda kar sakta hai. Tool aap ke title aur description ko behtar banata hai taake Google ko page samajhna asan ho. Number kitna aayega, ye page ki quality, competition aur waqt par hai.",
