      "Sawal 3: Kitne din mein farq nazar aayega? Jawab: Ye tay nahi hota. Kabhi naye page ko Google hafton mein utha leta hai, kabhi maheene lag jate hain. Tool aap ka kaam durust kar deta hai, lekin Google apne waqt par faisla karta hai. Sabr aur musalsal quality hi asal raasta hai."
