      "Then merge and download. Before submitting the result anywhere, open it and flip through every page. Check that nothing is missing, that scanned pages are upright, and that the final page is the one you expect — a thirty-second review that catches the classic error of uploading last year's version of a document.",
      "For images to PDF, add your photos or scans in reading order. Photographed documents benefit from a quick crop first if the edges show table, fingers or shadows; the cleaner the image, the more professional the final document looks. Convert, download, and again give the PDF a quick page-through on your phone — that is the device the recipient may well open it on.",
