      "Assalam o Alaikum dost, chai ka cup haath mein lein aur aaram se beth jayen, kyun ke aaj hum ek aisi cheez ki baat karne walay hain jo aap ki likhne ki zindagi badal sakti hai. Sochiye, aap ko ek lamba essay, ek zaroori email ya ek blog post likhna hai, aur keyboard par unglian chalana aap ko sust aur thaka dene wala kaam lagta hai. Ab zara tasawwur karein ke aap sirf bolna shuru karein aur aap ke alfaz khud ba khud screen par type hote jayen. Yahi voice typing hai, aur is guide mein hum isi ki poori kahani aaram se samjhayenge.",
      "Pehla Hissa: Voice Typing Kya Hoti Hai?",
