      "Khushi ki baat ye hai ke is ke liye aap ko koi software install nahi karna, koi paisay nahi dene, aur koi account nahi banana. Ye tool aap ke browser ke andar hi chalta hai. Aap bas page kholein, microphone ki ijazat dein, apni zuban chunein, aur bolna shuru kar dein. Jitni dair aap bolenge, utni dair text banta rahega. Rukna ho to button dabayen, text tayyar hai.",
