      "Dusra Qadam: Apni zuban chunein. Ye qadam sab se ahem hai aur yahin aksar log galti karte hain. Tool jo zuban aap chuneinge, usi ki aawazein aur alfaz sunne ki koshish karega. Agar aap Urdu bol rahe hain aur zuban English select hai, to nateeja ajeeb o gareeb niklega. To pehle zuban durust chunein, phir bolna shuru karein. Agar aap beech mein zuban badalna chahein, to pehle rok kar setting badlein, phir dobara shuru karein.",
      "Teesra Qadam: Start ka button dabayen aur aaram se bolna shuru karein. Bolne ka tareeqa wohi rakhein jo aap kisi dost ko baat samjhate hue rakhte hain. Na cheekhne ki zaroorat hai, na ek ek lafz alag tor par bolne ki. Aam raftaar, saaf awaaz, aur chhote chhote jumlay. Jab ek baat mukammal ho jaye to halka sa waqfa dein. Agar beech mein koi lafz galat ajaye to usi waqt theek karne ke chakkar mein na parein, poora khayal bol lein, durusti aakhir mein ek hi dafa aaram se ho jayegi.",
