      "Ek imaandaar baat yahan saaf saaf kehna zaroori hai. Chrome mein jab aap bolte hain to aap ki aawaz Google ki speech service ki taraf bheji jati hai, kyun ke ye bhari bharakam sunne ka kaam Google ke servers par hota hai. Wahan aap ki aawaz text mein badli jati hai aur wapas aap ke browser mein ajati hai. Hamari website khud na aap ki aawaz record karti hai na aap ka text mehfooz karti hai. Aap jo bolte hain woh aap ke browser ke session mein rehta hai, page band to baat khatam. Ye baat is liye batana zaroori hai taake aap poori maloomat ke saath apna faisla kar saken.",
