      "Dusri baat, shor is ka sab se bara dushman hai. Peechay chalta pankha, television ki aawaz, bahar ka traffic, ya paas bethay logon ki batein, ye sab aap ke text mein ghus sakti hain ya durusti ko kam kar sakti hain. Teesri baat, bohat tez bolna, munh mein batein dabana, ya bohat sakht ilaqai lehja bhi tool ko uljhan mein dal sakta hai, kyun ke phir usay andaza zyada lagana parta hai aur andazay kabhi kabhi galat nikalte hain.",
