      "Sawal: Kya website meri aawaz ya mera text mehfooz karti hai? Jawab: Nahi. Hamari website na aap ki aawaz record karti hai na aap ka text rakhti hai. Chrome mein aawaz Google ki speech service par text banne ke liye jati hai, aur bana hua text aap ke browser mein wapas aata hai jahan se aap use copy karte hain.",
