      "Sawal: Urdu bolne par text Urdu script mein kyun aata hai? Jawab: Kyun ke speech engine jis zuban ko sunta hai use usi ki asal likhayi mein likhta hai, aur Urdu ki asal likhayi Urdu script hai. Agar aap ko Roman Urdu chahiye to ya to text baad mein apne andaz mein badlein ya typing ka tareeqa istemal karein.",
      "Sawal: Kya main poora assignment ya essay isi se likh sakta hun? Jawab: Pehla draft bilkul bana sakte hain, aur bohat se log banate bhi hain. Lekin asal baat ye hai ke bola hua draft aap ke apne khayalat aur aap ki apni aawaz mein hona chahiye, aur jama karne se pehle use parhna, durust karna aur apni mehnat se final shakal dena aap ki zimmedari hai. Tool aap ka kaam tez karta hai, aap ki jagah mehnat nahi karta.",
      "Aakhri baat dost, technology ka asal fayda tab hai jab woh aap ki zindagi asaan kare, aap ki mehnat ki jagah na le. Voice typing ko apna pehla draft banane wala saathi bana lein, phir apni aqal, apni parhai aur apni mehnat se use mukammal karein. Chai khatam hone se pehle ek dafa zaroor azma kar dekhein, bolna shuru karein aur alfaz ko screen par chalta dekhein. Pehli dafa thora ajeeb lagega, dusri dafa aadat ban jayegi, aur teesri dafa aap sochenge ke ye sahulat pehle kyun nahi mili. Allah Hafiz, aur khush likhein."
