    "Yeh wali baat tab sab se zyada ahem hoti hai jab text kisi aur ka ya khufya ho. Hum chhote tools mein soche baghair kya kya paste kar dete hain: naukri chhodne wali email ka masuda, kisi client ka naam aur us ke order ki tafseel, bechne se pehle ki qeematon wali list, ya bachi ki admission ke liye likhi gayi darkhwast. Jo tool pehle server par bheje, wahan tumhein us ki policy par bharosa karna padta hai ke woh tumhara text rakhega, rakhega to kab tak, aur dekhega kaun. Yahan woh swal paida hi nahi hota kyunke text tumhare tab se bahar nikalta hi nahi.",
    "Na yahan sign up hai, na purani history ka panel hai, na cloud mein kahin tumhare jumlon ki copy hai. Tab band kiya, kahani khatam; page dobara kholo ge to bilkul khali milega. Tumhara browser apni history mein is page ka naam zaroor yaad rakh sakta hai, jaise har site ka rakhta hai, lekin tool khud tumhare likhe hue alfaz ka koi record nahi rakhta. Agar tum daftar, madarsa ya kisi client ke khufya kagazon ke saath kaam kar rahe ho to aise local tool ka istemal hi aqalmandi hai — bas yeh yaad rahe ke tumhare apne daftar ke network aur device ke usool phir bhi waisay hi lagoo rehte hain.",
    "Aksar pooche janay walay sawal, imandar hudood, aur akhri baat",
