    "Ab hudood bhi safai se sun lo. Sentence case grammar ki islah nahi hai: lowercase karne par UK, USA ya NADRA jaisay mukhaffafat Usa aur Nadra ban sakte hain, aur line break ke baad aane wala naam chhota reh sakta hai. Title Case ka bhi ek duniya bhar ka usool nahi hai — har akhbar aur university chhote alfaz alag likhta hai, aur Spanish mein headings mein English se kam bade hote hain. Tool ek mustaqil andaz lagata hai; apna style milana tumhari zimmedari hai.",
