      "Character counter hota kya hai, aur “character” ek seedhi si cheez kyun nahi",
      "Dekho yaar, chai ka cup haath mein lo, baat boht seedhi hai lekin thori si gehri bhi. Character counter text ko us ki sab se chhoti dikhne wali units mein napta hai. Sunne mein aasan, lekin asal sawal ye hai: ek character hota kya hai? Parhne wala lafz “a” mein ek cheez dekhta hai, “é” mein ek cheez, aur ek muskurate hue emoji mein bhi ek cheez. Computer teeno ko alag alag tareeqe se rakhta hai. “a” ek Unicode code point hai, ek UTF-16 unit aur ek UTF-8 byte. É agar alag accent ke saath likha ho to dikhne mein ek character, lekin do code points. Aur family wala emoji? Ek tasveer, lekin us ke andar saat code points, aath UTF-16 units aur pachis bytes tak chipa hota hai. Internet ka har counter chup chaap in mein se ek tareeqa chun leta hai, aur aksar batata bhi nahi ke chuna kya.",
      "Yahi woh wajah hai ke do imaandaar tools ek hi text par alag number de dete hain, aur jo post ek jagah “fit” hoti hai, platform use reject kar deta hai. Jahan limit dheeli ho — mazmoon, lambi caption — kisi ko farq nahi padta. Jahan limit sakht ho — 280 characters ki post, 150 ki bio, 30 ka ad headline, ya wo SMS jis ka bill segment se banta hai — wahan tareeqa hi poora khel hai. Is guide mein hum yehi samjhayenge ke ye counter is maslay ko imaandaari se kaise sambhalta hai: har ginti us ke tareeqe ke naam ke saath, aur wo limits jin ke liye log asal mein likhte hain.",
      "Ye character counter kya karta hai aur kya bilkul nahi karta",
      "Ye tool aap ke browser mein ginta hai, likhte, paste karte ya file kholte hi number live badalte hain. Sab se bara number Characters hai: grapheme clusters, yani wo units jo parhne wala asal mein dekhta hai. Us ke saath spaces ke baghair wali ginti, Unicode code points, UTF-16 units (jo lambai JavaScript aur aksar form fields istemal karte hain), UTF-8 bytes (storage ka size jo file, database aur API limits napti hain), rehnumai ke liye alfaz aur lines, aur select kiye hue hisse ki alag ginti. Neeche platform presets hain: ek select karen to pata chalta hai limit ka kitna hissa bhar gaya, kitna baqi hai, aur bar kab laal hoti hai. Is ke ilawa apni limit lagane ka box, aur SMS wala panel jo bata deta hai ke aap ka message abhi bhi puranay 160 wale jahaan mein hai ya 70 wale Unicode segments mein ja chuka hai.",
      "Ab sunen ye kya nahi karta, takay koi galat fehmi na rahe. Ye aap ka text kahin bhejta nahi: na upload, na account, na kal ke liye koi history. Ye ye wada nahi karta ke platform aap ka text qabool kar hi le ga, kyun ke har platform characters ko apne tareeqe se tolta hai aur limits baghair pooche badal deta hai. Ye text theek bhi nahi karta, chhota bhi nahi karta. Aur ye jaan boojh kar Word Counter nahi hai: wo tool batata hai ke aap ne kitna likha — alfaz, jumlay, parhne ka waqt, dohrae hue alfaz. Ye batata hai ke likha hua fit hota hai ya nahi, aur gina kis tareeqe se gaya hai. Dono pages ek dusre se jure hue hain, jis sawal ka jawab chahiye wahan ja sakte hain.",
      "Characters step by step ginna seekh lein",
      "Pehla qadam: text box mein daal dein. Keyboard se likhen, jis app mein draft ban raha hai wahan se paste karen, ya apne device se seedhi .txt, .md ya .csv file khol lein; file aap ke device par hi parhi jati hai, kahin upload nahi hoti. Aath counters ko dekhte jayen — aam prose ke paragraph mein zyada tar ek dusre se milte hain, aur jis lamhe alag hone lag jayen, samajh jayen ke emoji, accent wale haroof, jurne wale scripts ya symbols aa gaye hain; yehi woh lamha hai jahan ye tool kaam aata hai. Agar sirf ek hissa ahem hai — headline, pehli line, ek paragraph — sirf wahi select karen aur neeche wali selection strip parh lein, poora document zehan mein dobara ginne ki zaroorat nahi.",
      "Phir wo limit chunen jis ke khilaf likh rahe hain. Presets roz marra walay hain: X ki post, Instagram caption aur bio, TikTok caption, LinkedIn aur Facebook posts, YouTube title aur description, meta title aur description, aur Google Ads ki lines. Is ke ilawa jo kuch hai — exam form, dukaan wala field, database ka column — wo custom limit box mein jaye ga. Bar aur baqi wali ginti sirf ek sawal ka jawab deti hai: fit hota hai ya nahi, aur kitne se? Agar fit nahi hota to andaze se kaatne ke bajaye live number dekh kar kaaten, phir text copy karen ya .txt download kar lein. Aur ek aadat bana lein: scripts ya emoji mila lamba message bhejne se pehle SMS panel zaroor dekhen, kyun ke 160 se 70 wali chhup kar lagne wali chot wahin padti hai.",
      "Chaar gintiyon ko imaandaar misalon se samjhen",
