      "Emoji is farq ko aur khol deta hai. Ek aam muskurahat ek grapheme, ek code point, do UTF-16 units aur chaar UTF-8 bytes hai. Skin tone jor dein to do code points chipak jate hain. Family emoji kayi shakhs emoji ko zero-width joiners se jor kar ek tasveer banata hai — ek grapheme, saat ya zyada code points. Jo form “characters” browser ki built-in lambai se ginta hai, wo asal mein UTF-16 units gin raha hota hai, yani aap ki ek family tasveer andar ke har fard par do ki qeemat leti hai. Ye counter chaaro numbers is liye dikhata hai ke koi cheez surprise na rahe: parhne walon walay text ke liye grapheme ginti, technical limits ke liye bytes, aur JavaScript ki string lambai wali jagah ke liye UTF-16.",
      "Platform limits, presets, aur un ka imaandaar istemal",
