      "Do aadatain presets ko imaandaar rakhti hain. Pehli: yaad rakhen ke aakhri referee app khud hai. X kuch scripts aur emoji ko dugna ginta hai, links ko lapait kar fixed lambai leta hai, aur har jagah line breaks muft nahi hote. Post karte waqt agar platform ka apna counter is page se ikhtilaf kare to jeet platform ki hai — presets draft ki planning ke liye hain, compose box se behes ke liye nahi. Dusri: aakhri character tak kabhi na likhen. Limits badal jati hain, counters mein chhota sa farq rehta hai, aur jo caption bilkul 2,200 par band hui ho, wo ek khamosh platform update se katne wali hoti hai. Thora sa margin rakhen, text agle tabdeeli mein bhi bach jaye ga.",
      "SMS wala chakkar aur emoji par ikhtilaf",
