      "Emoji is se khamosh ikhtilaf paida karta hai. Grapheme tareeqe se ginne wala platform ek family emoji dekhta hai; UTF-16 units ginne wala form field aath dekhta hai; bytes ginne wala database pachis dekhta hai. Koi jhoot nahi bol raha — teeno alag sawalon ke jawab de rahe hain. Takleef tab hoti hai jab aap ek number se planning karen aur darwaze par khara ginne wala dusra istemal kare. Isi liye ye tool ek “sachcha” number dikhane se inkar karta hai: social limits ke liye parhne wala number, storage limits ke liye bytes, aur har tile par tareeqe ka naam, takay aap number ko usi limit se mila saken jo asal mein aap ke text ka faisla kare gi.",
