      "Log aksar yehi poochte hain. Kya ye muft hai? Ji, koi account nahi. Kya spaces ginte hain? Bari ginti mein ji — parhne wali aankh un se guzarti hai — aur baghair spaces wali ginti saath hi hai un forms ke liye jo dusri tarah poochte hain. Kaun se number par bharosa karun? Us par jo aap ki limit istemal karti hai: parhne walon walay platform limits ke liye graphemes, file aur API limits ke liye bytes, aksar form fields ke liye UTF-16. Word Counter kab istemal karun? Jab sawal ye ho ke kitna likha, ye nahi ke fit hota hai ya nahi — alfaz, jumlay, paragraphs, parhne ka waqt. Apne kaam ke liye ye ek chhota imaandaar machine hai: ye aap ka text behtar nahi banata, ye us ka size galat samajhna na mumkin bana deta hai."
