    "Kya mere blog ka reading time lamba ya chhota hona search ranking ko bigaar dega? Is baray mein koi wada hum nahi karein ge, kyun ke aisa wada karna hi ghalat hai. Seedhi baat ye hai: sach length label asal parhne wale ki madad karta hai, jo article waqt ki izzat karta hai log usay khatam karte hain, aur jo tehreer mukammal parhi jaye wohi shaya karne ke qabil hai. Mauzu ko jitni length chahiye utni rakhein, label sach likhein, aur reading time ko pressure nahi, planning ka dost samjhein.",
