      "Ab do baatein imaandaari se sun lo, kyunke aksar slug wale tools ye chhupate hain. Pehli: saaf slug is baat ki guarantee nahi ke Google tumhari page ko rank karega ya index hi karega. Slug ka kaam address ko parhne, bolne aur share karne ke qabil banana hai — jo asal mein faida hai — magar rank ka faisla page ke content, usko milne wale links aur poori site karti hai. Dusri: ye tool formatter hai, editor nahi. Ye tumhare liye keywords nahi gharega, aur ye nahi batayega ke purane URL ko badalna redirect ke kharche ke qabil hai ya nahi. Ye faislay tumhare hain; safai aur typing hamari hai.",
