      "Ek asal zindagi ki misal lo. Maan lo tum ek college student ho aur apni assignments aur notes ke liye ek blog bana rahe ho. Title: 'Class 10 Ke Liye Physics Ke Important Numericals Aur Un Ke Hal'. Poora slug ye hoga: class-10-ke-liye-physics-ke-important-numericals-aur-un-ke-hal — sach hai, magar lamba hai. Ab socho ke parhne wala asal mein dhoondh kya raha hai: physics numericals. To slug class-10-physics-important-numericals kaafi hai. Ye faisla tool nahi kar sakta; ye tumhari samajh hai ke page kis ke liye hai. Tool ka kaam ye hai ke tum jo alfaaz do, unhein safai se jod de, aur live preview tumhein foran dikhaye ke kaata hua slug parhne mein kaisa lagta hai. Isi tarah ek chhoti dukaan ke liye socho: 'Lahore Mein Home Delivery Ke Saath Fresh Atta Aur Gur' ki jagah fresh-atta-gur-home-delivery zyada saaf aur zyada yaad rehne wala hai. Slug chhota rakhna matlab mauzu ko chhupana nahi; matlab fazool alfaaz ka bojh utarna hai.",
      "Lambai ki ek aur wajah hai: lambe addresses kat jate hain. Google ke results mein aakhir nazar nahi aata, WhatsApp ke preview mein chhup jata hai, aur phone par koi chalees alfaaz ka address bol bhi nahi sakta. Teen se chhe alfaaz aam tor par kaafi hote hain. Isi liye tool tumhein characters ki ginti saath saath dikhata hai, aur maximum length wali setting slug ko lafz ke beech se nahi kaat-ti, poora lafz gira kar rukti hai. Alfaaz tum chunte ho; qainchi safai se chalana hamara kaam hai.",
      "Step by step: title se slug tak",
      "Shuru mein us page ka title chipkayo jo tum publish karne wale ho — blog post, product, recipe, landing page, sab chalega. Fileon ya folders ke naam saaf karne hon to bhi yehi tareeqa hai. Neeche slug khud banta jayega; koi generate button dabana hi nahi, to title badalna aur address badalna ek hi harakat ban jati hai. Agar pehle dekhna hai ke options kya karte hain, to sample wala button dabakar teen tayyar titles par azma lo.",
      "Phir options chuno. Pehle separator: web pages ke liye hyphen, file naamon ke liye underscore. Phir stop words: on karo to the, and, of jaisi chhoti English alfaaz nikal jayengi; band rakho jab koi chhota lafz matlab utha raha ho — how-to-fix-a-leak aur how-fix-leak parhne wale ke liye ek jaise nahi hain. Phir accent wali setting: on ho to Café ka é saada e ban jata hai; band karo to wo haroof nikal jate hain, jo aam tor par tum nahi chahte. Aakhir mein maximum length, agar tumhare CMS ya apne usool ki demand ho.",
      "Jab slug theek lage, ek click se copy karo aur WordPress, Shopify, Webflow — jahan publish karte ho — ke URL wale khane mein chipka do. Publish se pehle, baad mein nahi. List chipkayi ho to tool har title ke samne uska slug dikhata hai, ek nazar mein saare check kar lo, phir saare copy kar lo ya chhoti si text file download kar lo. Aur ek mashwara: copy karne se pehle slug ek dafa parh zaroor lo. Ye chhota hai, hamesha ke liye hai, aur abhi sudharna baad ki nisbat boht asaan hai.",
      "Hyphen, underscore aur chhote haroof ke chhote usool",
