      "Chhote haroof mashwara nahi, hifazat hai. Aksar servers par URL ke raste case-sensitive hote hain, yani /Biryani-Recipes aur /biryani-recipes do alag addresses ban sakte hain. Ek hi link alag capitalisation ke saath share ho to copies ban sakti hain ya link toot sakta hai. Is liye tool hamesha chhote haroof hi deta hai, is mein setting ka koi khel nahi. Numbers bach jate hain — 10-best-recipes ka 10 mehfooz hai — aur apostrophe separator nahi banta, to Google's Guide, googles-guide banta hai, wo akela reh jane wala google-s-guide nahi jo aksar generators chor jate hain.",
      "Accent, Japanese aur Roman Urdu: transliteration ki imaandaar baat",
