      "Japanese aur Urdu script wale titles alag kahani hain, aur ye guide wahan dhoka nahi degi. Ye tool unka transliteration nahi karta. Kanji, kana aur Urdu script ke haroof slug ke alphabet se bahar hain aur nikal jate hain — is liye jab page unhein dekhta hai to tumhein khabar bhi deta hai. Imaandaar tareeqa ye hai ke roman shakal tum khud likho — Japanese ke liye romaji, Urdu ke liye Roman Urdu — aur phir safai tool par chor do: Waqfay Kay Baad Ka Khana banega waqfay-kay-baad-ka-khana, chipkane ke liye tayyar. Hijae tum chunte ho, kyunke roman likhne ke faislay asal faislay hain; tool bas tumhari taraf se khamoshi se andaza lagane se inkaar karta hai.",
