      "Aur ye bhi yaad rakho ke tumhara slug tumhare apne folder wale hisse ke saath mil kar parha jata hai. Agar page pehle se /blog/ folder mein hai, to slug mein blog ya article dobara lagana fazool hai; agar product hai to shayad category ka lafz waisa hi folder mein hoga. Acha slug wahi hai jo akele khara hokar bhi samajh aaye, aur poore address ke saath aur bhi zyada saaf ho. Isi liye copy karne se pehle use poore URL ke tor par ek dafa bol kar dekho — jo cheez zuban par atke, wo parhne wale ki aankh par bhi atkegi.",
      "Stop words, lambai ki limit aur batch mode",
