    "Lorem ipsum asal mein hai kya",
    "Yaar, chai ka cup hath mein pakro aur pehle yeh samajh lo ke lorem ipsum koi jadui Latin dua nahi hai, aur na hi yeh koi secret code hai jise parh kar client impress ho jaye ga. Yeh asal mein Cicero ki mashhoor kitaab de Finibus Bonorum et Malorum se liye gaye tukray hain, jo 45 BC mein likhi gayi thi. Kisi purane typesetter ne un jumlon ko ulta seedha kar ke aisi shakal de di ke alfaz asal lagte hain, magar matlab taqreeban khatam ho jata hai. Bas yehi is ki khoobi hai.",
    "Jab aap kisi design mein asal Urdu ya English headline laga dete hain, to har banda lafz parhne lagta hai. Koi kehta hai yeh jumla lamba hai, koi kehta hai yeh lafz mujhe pasand nahi. Magar lorem ipsum parh kar dimagh do second mein haar maan leta hai. Phir nazar khud ba khud spacing, font size, button ki jagah aur page ke overall balance par chali jati hai. Matlab, baat alfaz se nikal kar design par aa jati hai, aur yehi hum chahte hain.",
    "Lahore ke ek chhote se design studio ka scene socho. Wahan ek larka bakery ki website bana raha hai, owner abhi menu finalize nahi kar paya, magar layout to dikhana hai. Agar woh khaali boxes bhej de to owner bolega bhai yeh kya bheja hai. Agar woh lorem ipsum bhar de, to design zinda lagta hai. Owner bhi samajh jata hai ke yeh sirf jagah bharne ke liye hai, asal mithaas baad mein aaye gi. Yeh farq chhota lagta hai, magar kaam mein bara kaam karta hai.",
    "Yeh nakli text kab kaam ka hai aur kab bilkul mana hai",
    "Dekho dost, placeholder text tab best hota hai jab kaam abhi adhoora ho magar soch ko aage barhana ho. Freelancer ko portfolio ka mockup banana hai, student ko assignment ka prototype dikhana hai, ya kisi dukaan ki website ka pehla khaka banana hai. Aise mein asal content ka intezaar karna sirf waqt zaya hai. Lorem ipsum daal do, layout chal pare ga, aur baaki log apna kaam karte rahen ge. Zindagi rukti nahi, project bhi nahi rukta.",
    "Yeh text is liye bhi acha hai ke meetings seedhi rehti hain. Aksar client asal headline dekh kar lafzon par behes shuru kar deta hai, aur bechara design peeche reh jata hai. Ek dafa Karachi ki ek freelancer dost ne mujhe bataya ke us ka client har review mein sirf tagline badalta raha, aur teen haftay layout waisa ka waisa raha. Jab us ne lorem ipsum laga diya, to pehli dafa baat button, rang aur mobile view par hui. Kabhi kabhi peeche hatna hi aage barhne ka tareeqa hota hai.",
    "Magar ab sakht wali baat sun lo. Yeh text live website par kabhi nahi lagana. Na SEO mein is ka koi faida hai, na visitor ko is se kuch samajh aata hai. Google bhi parh lega, magar rank karne layak wahan kuch hota hi nahi. Agar page public ho gaya aur andar lorem ipsum reh gaya, to log samjhen ge ke kaam adhoora chhor diya gaya hai. Launch se pehle har block ko asal, saaf aur parhe gaye content se badalna lazmi hai. Yeh rule todna apni hi mehnat par paani pher deta hai.",
    "Generator ko step by step kaise istemal karein",
    "Sab se pehle mode select karo, aur yeh kaam container ko dekh kar karo. Agar tumhein blog ka body text chahiye to paragraphs wala mode lo. Agar chhoti descriptions, cards ya testimonial ki jagah bharni hai to sentences behtar rahen ge. Aur agar sirf headline ke neeche ek chhoti si line ya button ke paas thodi si dummy jagah chahiye, to words mode kaafi hoga. Pehle socho jagah kaisi hai, phir text banao. Ulta karoge to baad mein settings badalte phiro ge.",
    "Us ke baad count set karo, matlab kitne paragraphs, sentences ya words chahiye. Phir format chuno: plain text, HTML ke p tags, ya list. Agar tum chahte ho ke text bilkul classic andaaz se Lorem ipsum se shuru ho, to start wala toggle on kar do. Warna off rehne do, text thoda kam pehchana jaye ga. Generate dabao, neeche live word count dekho, phir copy kar lo ya .txt file download kar lo. Agar length pasand na aaye, dobara generate kar lo. Bas, koi rocket science nahi hai.",
    "Meri apni aadat yeh hai ke mein hamesha teen version bana leta hun. Ek chhota, ek normal, aur ek woh wala jo client baad mein bhej kar kehta hai bas yehi daal dein. Woh teesra version aksar sab se lamba hota hai. Jab design un teeno ko jhel leta hai, to dil ko tasalli ho jati hai ke kal ko asal text aane par layout cheekh nahi mare ga. Yeh chhoti si aadat bohat si raaton ki neend bacha leti hai, sach mein.",
    "Plain text, HTML aur list mein farq samjho",
