    "HTML format un logon ke liye hai jo code ke andar kaam karte hain. Jab tum p tags ke sath text lete ho, to use seedha web page ke template mein chipka sakte ho. CSS test karna ho, line height dekhna ho, ya mobile par paragraph ka tootna check karna ho, to yeh format waqt bachata hai. Bas ek khayal rahe, yeh suvidha staging ya local file tak hi rakho. Public page par tags ke sath nakli text lagana matlab apni hi dukaan ke sheeshe par mazaq likh dena hai.",
    "List format menus, features, footer links aur FAQ ke khakon ke liye bohat kaam ka hai. Socho tum ek mobile repair shop ki website bana rahe ho aur paanch services ki list test karni hai. List generate kar ke daal do, foran pata chal jaye ga ke items saans le rahe hain ya ek dusre par charhe hue hain. Agar nakli list hi tang lag rahi hai, to asal lambay service names aane par haal aur bura hoga. Is liye list wala test pehle kar lena aqalmandi hai.",
    "Kitna text lena chahiye, andaza kaise lagayein",
