    "Har hisse ki zaroorat alag hoti hai. Headline ko hamesha chhote, darmiyane aur badtameez had tak lambay jumlon se test karo, kyun ke asal editor kabhi kabhi bohat lambi headline likh deta hai. Cards mein yeh dekho ke ek description lambi ho jaye to button neeche bhaagta to nahi. Forms mein labels aur chhoti hidayat wali lines ka wrap hona check karo. Tables sab se zalim test hote hain, kyun ke nakli text shaant lagta hai magar asal product names ate hi table phattne lagta hai.",
    "Ek asaan sa tareeqa yeh hai ke pehle chhota sa content budget bana lo. Misal ke tor par hero headline barah lafz, us ke neeche wali line pachis lafz, card ka text tees lafz, aur FAQ ka jawab nabbe lafz. Phir generator ko unhi hudood ke aas paas chalao. Is se design khayali dunia mein nahi banta, asal zindagi ke qareeb banta hai. Baad mein jab client asal content bhejta hai, to hairani kam hoti hai aur ghussa to bilkul bhi nahi aata.",
    "Ek aur chhoti si baat zehen mein rakho, har jagah ka asal text ek hi raftar se nahi ata. Kuch clients foran bhej dete hain, kuch hafte laga dete hain. Isi liye apne design ko itna sakht mat banao ke sirf ek khaas lambai par hi woh haseen lage. Jo layout thodi si kami beshi has kar bardasht kar le, wohi asal zindagi mein jeetta hai. Tumhari tension bhi kam hogi aur client ki der bhi design ko nahi giraye gi.",
