    "Doosri sachai yeh hai ke nakli Latin text asal zindagi ke masail chhupa leta hai. Yeh nahi batata ke lamba Pakistani naam testimonial card ko kaise toray ga, ya mobile par ek lambi English headline doosri line mein ja kar kaisi lage gi. Yeh to bilkul bhi nahi batata ke Urdu script wali line kahan se shuru hogi. Is liye lorum ipsum ko sirf shuruat samjho. Aakhir mein asal naam, asal qeemat aur asal zabaan ka ek sample zaroor daal kar dekho. Tabhi design sach mein test hota hai.",
    "Yeh bhi yaad rakho ke har dafa generate karne par text thoda mukhtalif ho sakta hai. Yeh koi masla nahi, bas jab koi version client ko dikha kar approve karwa lo, to usi ko .txt file mein download kar ke project ke sath rakh lo. Warna baad mein tum wohi block dhoondte phiro ge jo meeting mein sab ko pasand aya tha. Aur haan, yeh generator tumhein acha writer nahi banata. Yeh sirf jagah bharta hai. Bharosay wala asal content to insan ko hi soch kar likhna parta hai.",
