    "Chalte hue countdown mein progress bar digits ke saath saath khaali hoti hai, is liye ye timer door se, aur geele ya aatay walay haathon ke saath bhi parha jata hai — kitchen mein yehi asal test hai. Pause baqi waqt ko bilkul wahan rok deta hai jahan woh tha, aur Resume tick ginnay ki bajaye timestamps se dobara hisaab karke aage barhta hai, is liye darmiyan mein tab badalna ya phone ki screen ka so jana hisaab kharab nahi karta. Woh mashhoor lamha jab sab kehte hain bas ek minute aur dedo, us ke liye +1 minute wala button hai: poora session dobara shuru kiye baghair ek minute jude jata hai. Reset tumhe usi set kiye hue waqt par wapas le jata hai, agle round ke liye tayyar.",
    "Aakhir zero par tool apni finish halat chamkata hai, aur agar awaz on ho aur browser ijazat de to ek chhoti si beep bajti hai. Is beep ko kandhe par ek mazboot thapka samjho, fire alarm nahi. Agar exact aakhri second ahem hai — maslan koi timed test ya hassas cooking ka step — to tab ko saamne aur device ko unmute rakho. Kyun, ye agla section baghair kisi meethi baat ke samjhata hai.",
