    "Pehle ye samajh lo: resize, crop aur compress teen alag naukriyan hain",
    "Dost, chai ka cup haath mein lo aur ye ek baat pakki kar lo, kyunki aadhi pareshaani yahi se shuru hoti hai. Resize, crop aur compress — ye teen lafz sunne mein aik jaise lagte hain, lekin ye teen bilkul alag kaam hain. Resize ka matlab hai poori tasveer ke pixel dimensions badal dena: 4000×3000 wali photo 1200×900 ho jaye, sab kuch nazar aaye, bas chhoti ho jaye. Crop ka matlab hai tasveer ka aik hissa chun kar baaki phenk dena: wahi photo darmiyaan se square ban jaye. Aur compress ka matlab hai dimensions bilkul wohi rahen, sirf file halki ho jaye. Ye page pehle do kaam karta hai. Agar aap ki tasveer ki shape pehle se theek hai aur sirf file bhari hai, to is site ka Image Compressor aap ka sahi darwaza hai — wohi dimensions andar, halki file bahar. Ye farq mamuli nahi hai. Main ne logon ko dekha hai ke woh 6000 pixel wali photo ko compress par compress kiye jate hain, halanke jagah sirf 800 pixel ki hai — file halki ho gayi, lekin page phir bhi slow, kyunki browser ko har dafa us barri tasveer ko chhota karna parta hai. Is ke ulta, kuch log lambi portrait photo ko chauray thumbnail wale khane mein baghair crop kiye thoons dete hain, aur chehray chaure ho jate hain. To pehla hunar click karna nahi hai, kaam ka naam lena hai: naye dimensions chahiye to resize, nayi shape chahiye to pehle crop phir resize, sirf halki file chahiye to compress.",
    "Ab asal scene samjho: form par tasveer lagani hai, jagah keh rahi hai ke photo itne se barri na ho, ya profile wale gol dabbe ne sar kaat diya hai, ya YouTube thumbnail par tasveer khenchi hui lag rahi hai. Ye roz ke masle hain — school admission form, naukri ki application, dukaan ki product photo, WhatsApp par bhejna ke file bohat barri hai. In sab ka hal is page par hai, lekin hal tab milega jab aap pehle ye tay kar len ke masla asal mein hai kya. Masla size ka hai ya shape ka? Aksar logon ko size ka lagta hai, asal mein shape ka hota hai. Instagram par square post chahiye aur photo chauri hai — ye size ka masla hi nahi, shape ka masla hai, aur is ka hal resize nahi, crop hai. Isi liye is guide mein hum pehle ye teenon ka farq bilkul saaf karenge, phir pixel, percentage aur ratio ko dostana andaz mein samjhenge, phir presets, phir phone ki terhi photo wala masla, aur aakhir mein wo checklist jo aap ko har dafa download se pehle dekhni hai. Aaram se parho, ye guide aap ko aik dafa samjha dega aur phir har kaam tees second ka ho jayega.",
    "Chhota karne aur barra karne par tasveer ke andar asal mein hota kya hai",
    "Digital photo asal mein chhote chhote rangon wale khanon — pixels — ka aik jaal hota hai. Jab aap resize karte hain, browser wo jaal dobara likhta hai. Chhota karna aik imaandaar tabahi hai: 4000 pixel chauri photo ko 1000 pixel karna ho to browser parosi pixels ke groups ko mila kar aik naya pixel banata hai. Un groups mein jo bareek tafseel rehti thi — baal, chhota text, door ke chehray — woh average ho kar ghayab ho jati hai. Ye is tool ki khaami nahi hai; ye resize ka matlab hi hai, duniya ke har tool mein, chahe muft ho ya mehenga. Is ka amli nateeja ye hai ke apni asli file hamesha sambhal kar rakho. Copy par resize karo, copy upload karo, aur agar kal ko barri size ki zarurat par jaye to master aap ke paas mehfooz hai. Barra karna is ka ulta hisaab hai aur is ki had bhi ulti hai: 800 pixel ko 2400 karna ho to browser beech wale pixels parosiyon ko mila kar bana leta hai. File waqai barri ho jati hai, lekin tasveer naram par jati hai, kyunki koi tool woh detail paida nahi kar sakta jo camera ne kabhi li hi nahi. Jo koi ye dawa kare ke wo chhoti photo ko barra aur tez kar dega sirf resizer se, samajh lo woh dhund ko achi marketing mein bech raha hai.",
    "Aik aur khamosh tabdeeli bhi saath chalti hai: dobara encode hona. JPG ya WebP mein save karna tasveer ko dobara compress karta hai, aur quality slider tay karta hai ke ye kitni sakhti se hoga. Quality 100 par file wafadaar lekin bhari hoti hai; 70 par bohat halki aur farq sirf bohat zoom karne par nazar aata hai; 40 par text ke kinare aur aasman par dhabbe se banne lagte hain. PNG is khel mein hissa hi nahi leta — woh har pixel bilkul saheeh rakhta hai, quality slider ko manta hi nahi, is liye barri photograph ke liye galat intekhab aur logo, screenshot ya transparent tasveer ke liye bilkul sahi intekhab hai. Aik acha usool yaad kar lo: photo ho to JPG ya WebP, graphic ya logo ho to PNG. Aur haan, har dobara encode par JPG thori quality deta hai, is liye aik hi file ko baar baar resize-save karne se woh ahista ahista kharab hoti jati hai — hamesha asli file se shuru karo, darmiyaani copy se nahi.",
    "Saheeh pixels, percentage, aur woh taala jo aap ki tasveer ko khenchnay se bachata hai",
    "Is tool mein size batane ke do tareeqay hain. Pehla: saheeh pixels. Ye un jaghon ke liye hai jahan jagah ka apna qanoon hota hai — form literally 1080×1080 maang raha hai, thumbnail 1280×720 hai, print shop A4 maang raha hai 300 DPI par, matlab 2480×3508 pixels. Numbers likho, kaam khatam. Doosra: percentage. Ye baaki sab ke liye hai — aadhi kar do, chauthai kar do email ke liye — aur is ki khoobi ye hai ke is mein tanasub kharab ho hi nahi sakta. Teesra control wo taala hai, aspect ratio lock, jisay naye log nazar-andaz karte hain aur phir pachtate hain. Taala on ho to width likhne se height khud asal tanasub se nikal aati hai, tasveer kabhi khenchti nahi. Taala off ho to aap koi bhi chaurai-lambai zabardasti rakh sakte hain — banner ke liye sahi, insaan ke chehray ke liye tabahi. Seedha usool: logon aur products ke liye taala on, taala off sirf tab jab aap jaan boojh kar nayi shape chahte hain aur crop ka plan hai.",
    "Ab presets ki baat — ye is liye hain ke platform ke sizes koi ratta na mare. Instagram post 1080×1080, portrait 1080×1350, story 1080×1920; YouTube thumbnail 1280×720; X post 1200×675; profile photo 800×800 takay gol mask mein bhi chehra mehfooz rahe; A4 ko imaandaari se pixels mein likha hai, 150 DPI screen documents ke liye aur 300 DPI print ke liye. Do imaandaar warnings saath sun lo. Pehli: platforms apne recommended sizes baghair bataye badal dete rehte hain, is liye presets ko aaj ki behtareen mashwara samjho, qanoon nahi — aakhri faisla hamesha usi site ke uploader ki preview karegi jahan aap upload kar rahe hain. Doosri: DPI sirf print mein matlab rakhta hai. Screen par 1240×1754 aur 2480×3508 sirf do pixel jaal hain; 300 DPI wala preset sirf tab faida dega jab waqai print hona hai. Web upload par quality ke naam par 300 DPI chunna sirf file bhari karega, screen par tasveer wohi rahegi. Aur aik chhoti si baat output size par: har browser ki canvas ki aik had hoti hai, is liye tool output ko 8000 pixel tak rakhta hai — ye roz ke har kaam se kahin zyada hai.",
    "Shape galat ho to pehle crop, phir resize — yehi woh tartib hai jo chehray bachati hai",
    "Ab woh workflow jo khenchi hui tasveeron ka ilaj hai. Agar jagah square hai aur aap ki photo chauri hai, to resize wale khano mein taala off karke 1080×1080 hargiz na likho — ye khenchnay ka order hai, aur tool wafadaari se aap ke subject ko dabaa dega. Is ke bajaye Crop wala tab kholo, 1:1 ratio chuno, aur box ko us hisay par drag karo jo asal mein matter karta hai; box square rahega, aap aaram se compose kar sakte ho. Ratio asal mein naamon wali shapes hain: 4:5 Instagram ki lambi portrait shape hai, 16:9 video aur thumbnails ki, 3:2 camera ki classic shape, 9:16 phone ki screen. Crop hi woh wahid step hai jahan aap editor wala faisla karte hain — kya rakhna hai, kya phenkna hai — is liye paanch second sakoon se lo. Chehron ke ird gird thori saans ki jagah chhorna, kyunki platforms ko buttons aur gol mask bilkul unhi konon par lagane ki aadat hai jahan aap ne peshani bhar di thi. Crop set ho jaye to resize wale khane ab aap ke crop wale hisay ko describe karte hain: saheeh output size likho, crop saaf taur par us mein scale ho jayega.",
    "Aik aur scene: aksar kaam sirf shape ka nahi, hisay ka hota hai. Scan ki hui page se sirf signature kaatna hai, dukaan ki shelf wali photo se sirf aik product alag karna hai, group photo se sirf aik banda chahiye profile ke liye. Yahan Free ratio kaam aata hai — koi bandhi hui shape nahi, jahan marzi box banao. Aur jab box banao to kenare par jaldi mat karo; aik do pixel idhar udhar baad mein nazar aata hai, khaas taur par jab usi crop ko phir barra size dena ho. Crop ke neeche aap ko crop ka size pixels mein nazar aata rahega, takay aap ko pata ho ke aap asal mein kitna hissa le rahe hain. Agar ghalti ho jaye to Reset crop se poori tasveer wapas aa jati hai — asli file to waise bhi mehfooz hi hai, ye sirf preview par kaam ho raha hai. Yehi is local tool ki khoobi hai: ghalti ki koi qeemat nahi, dobara kar lo.",
    "Phone ki terhi photo, HEIC, aur woh imaandaar rukawatain jo pehle se pata honi chahiye",
    "Agar aap ne kabhi phone ki photo upload ki aur woh terhi nazar aayi, to aap EXIF orientation se mil chuke hain: bohat se phones tasveer ko baghair ghumaye save karte hain aur ye seedha hai wala ishara metadata mein chhupa dete hain. Ye tool jahan browser support karta hai, createImageBitmap ko from-image orientation ke saath istemal karta hai, is liye aksar phone photos khud seedhi aa jati hain. Jahan browser doosra rasta leta hai, tool preview ke neeche saaf likh deta hai, khamoshi se terhi tasveer nahi deta — pehle apni photo app mein seedha karo, phir resize karo. Ye imaandaari is liye zaruri hai ke user ko pata ho masla kahan hai. Doosri rukawatain bhi pehle se sun lo: tool JPG, PNG aur WebP leta hai, kyunki yehi woh formats hain jo browsers bharosay se decode aur encode karte hain. iPhone ki HEIC photo ko koi bhi browser tool nahi parh sakta — phone se JPG ke taur par share karo, phir yahan lao. Aur bohat barri photos, masalan 50 megapixel wali, sahi process hoti hain lekin purane phone par chand seconds le sakti hain, kyunki kaam server ki farm nahi, aap ka apna device kar raha hai. Yehi qeemat hai is baat ki ke aap ki tasveer kabhi upload nahi hoti.",
    "Ab aakhir mein woh imaandaari jo har image tool ko likhni chahiye lekin aksar nahi likhta. Chhota karna detail ko hamesha ke liye phenk deta hai — is ka koi undo nahi, sirf asli file hi wahid sahara hai. Barra karna asli detail paida nahi karta, chahe file ka size teen guna kyun na ho jaye. Aur jab aap ko sirf file halki chahiye ho, size wohi rakhna ho, to ye tool galat darwaza hai — Image Compressor par jao, woh dimensions ko haath lagaye baghair file ko halka karta hai. In dono tools ko alag rakhna hi is site ka usool hai: aik page, aik keyword, aik kaam. Resizer dimensions aur crop badalta hai; Compressor wazan badalta hai. Dono local hain, dono muft hain, aur dono aap ki tasveer ko server par nahi bhejte. Ye farq samajh gaya to aap kabhi galat tool par waqt zaya nahi karenge.",
    "Download se pehle wali chhoti checklist — tees second, zero pachtava",
    "Aakhir mein ye checklist apne zehen mein bitha lo, zyadatar nakamiyan kabhi hongi hi nahi. Aik: kaam resize hai, crop hai ya compress — kya main sahi tool par hoon? Do: kya mujhe asal jagah ka saheeh size pata hai, usi site ke uploader ya help page se, kisi blog ki yaad se nahi? Teen: agar shape alag hai to kya mein ne khenchnay ke bajaye ratio se crop kiya? Chaar: format — photo hai to JPG ya WebP, logo ya transparent hai to PNG? Paanch: quality — photos ke liye 80 se 85 wo meethi jagah hai jo koi pehchan nahi sakta; is se neeche sirf tab jao jab file ki had majboor kare. Chhe: process ke baad Before/After wala hissa parho — dimensions aur file size dono likhe nazar aate hain — aur preview ko poori size par dekho, khaas taur par text aur chehray. Saat: download karo, phir resize wali copy ko us ki asal jagah upload karke wahan dekho, kyunki har platform apne tareeqay se dobara crop aur compress karta hai. Aath: asli file ko bilkul mat chherro — camera roll ya folder mein mehfooz rehne do; resize wali file delivery copy hai, master nahi. Ye aath kaam kar lo, to ye mamuli sa resizer aap ke liye lottery nahi rahega: ye wo hoga jo hona chahiye, tees second ki bor lekin yaqini kamyabi. Aur haan, pehli dafa kisi bhi nayi jagah ke liye upload karna ho to aik hi photo par try karo, preview dekho, phir baaki kaam — yehi woh aadat hai jo professionals ko beginners se alag karti hai."
